{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西貢今日（27日）發現人骨。下午1時39分，警方接獲報案，大網仔路與鳳秀路交上址對開岩石岸上石間，發現懷疑人類骸骨。</p><p>警員接報到場，在上址發現並檢取該懷疑人類骸骨作進一步化驗。據悉現場只發現頭骨。案件暫列發現人類骸骨，交由黃大仙警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"案件交由黃大仙警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251029/1060122672991571968185306.jpeg/-RAJ4XpBcNJ9t8J4pE7yHggBnJZV3metFzCtbhcwrW4\"/><figcaption>案件交由黃大仙警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:04:02.564817+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:46:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:37:42.088485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:37.016722+00:00","content_hash":"d61750eabdd74e93d625879d9e84ba501fd4f4d3428659205caedba99f08e824","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}